 "description": "<p>Decorative socks in cutout lace, polyester, in red, white, or black. The cutouts are what lift these above plain lace stockings - patterned negative space along the leg.</p>\n<p>The colorway trio covers the standard outfit palettes: red for costume occasions, black for everyday layering, white for bridal-adjacent looks. Polyester construction keeps them durable where sheer hosiery is not.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester lace</li>\n<li>Item type: decorative socks</li>\n<li>Style: cutout, oriental-inspired pattern</li>\n<li>Color: red, white, or black</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Three shades. The finishing hosiery for lingerie sets and costumes that stop at the ankle unadorned.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Romantic cutout lace socks in red, white or black polyester, decorative pattern.</p>\n",
